cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PLSsemLab: A jamovi Module for Partial Least Squares Structural Equation Modeling"
message: >
  If you use PLSsemLab in your research, please cite the software using the
  metadata below, and cite cSEM and the methods it implements as listed in
  docs/Bibliography.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chacón Chacón"
    given-names: "Arquímedes De León"
    affiliation: "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7014-7513"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArchieJamDev/PLSsemLab"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
version: "0.0.0"
abstract: >
  PLSsemLab is an open-source jamovi module, in design stage, that brings
  partial least squares structural equation modeling (PLS-SEM) to jamovi with
  the cSEM R package, pairing every result with evidence-based methodological
  guidance, interpretation and educational support in English and Spanish.
keywords:
  - jamovi
  - PLS-SEM
  - Partial Least Squares
  - Structural Equation Modeling
  - Composite-based SEM
  - cSEM
  - Open Science
language: en
